      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZEAL BEAUTY (1) doesn't show much early dash but winds into her races, two back missing the frame but last time hitting the line hard to place when second (19.39) in a Grade 5 at this track last time. Strike rate this distance strong having won two of four tries. Won at her only start from this draw. Key chance in this line up. BAIL JUMPER (5) boasts a strong record this journey with five wins and two minors from nine tries. Below best last time at Wentworth Park (30.65) in a Grade 5, finishing a 17 length sixth. Looks suited here and can measure up. LOCO BLAZE (8) comes here following a handy win over 340m at this track in 19.21. Top win latest and rates a key player again. LIGHTNING LOTTE (4) missed the placings here last start but is well-placed to atone.",
